# Line endings: the repo is LF everywhere (the boxes run Debian, vectors and
# unit files are compared byte for byte). A Windows checkout with autocrlf
# otherwise turns vectors and scripts into CRLF and fails their --check tests.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
*.bat -text
*.cmd -text
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
*.pdf binary
*.iso binary
*.jks binary
*.p8 binary
*.xcresult binary
